hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"540","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Kisra halak hoga, aur us ke baad koi Kisra nahin hoga. Aur Qaisar halak hoga, aur us ke baad koi Qaisar nahin hoga. Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai! Tum un donon ke khazane Allah ke raste mein kharch karoge.'"
"541","[AI-translation] Waki' (Rahimahullah) ne isi sanad se pichli hadees ki manind riwayat ki."
"542","[AI-translation] Isi sanad se: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Main tumhen apni taraf se kuch nahin deta aur na tum se rokta hun; main sirf khazanchi hun, aur main waisa hi deta hun jaisa mujhe hukm diya jata hai.'"
